We will be implementing this interface for different persistence types.
As you can see, handling the Create command looks different from handling all other
commands. This is natural since when we create a new entity, we need to ensure it does not
exist yet. When we handle operations on the existing entity, it works the other way around.
In this case, we need to ensure that the entity exists, otherwise, we cannot perform the
operation and must throw an exception.
